  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support implementation of the Territorial Climate Plan in the B&#xe9;lier region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised NDC gives an important place to territorial authorities, the government objective is to support these authorities in the context of the NDC implementation. Within the framework of the NDC Support Program, the B&#xe9;lier region have benefited from the preparation of a Territorial Climate Plan. The requested support concerns the implementation of the action plan identified in the territorial plan that should contribute to the NDC implementation, through: - Modernization of market gardening through the use of solar pumps - Project to improve energy efficiency in rural areas by introducing a photovoltaic system in public establishments - Project to produce fuel briquettes from agricultural waste and management and distribution of improved stoves - Sustainable Agriculture Demonstration Project Adapted to Climate Change in the Kan area</narrative>
  </description>
